{
  "id": "npc_xuewuhen",
  "title": "血无痕对话",
  "description": "血刹教弟子血无痕的日常对话",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "xuewuhen",
    "npc_name": "血无痕",
    "location": "血刹教"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "...你胆子不小，竟敢主动接近血刹教的人。说吧，找我何事？",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_purpose",
          "text": "血刹教究竟意欲何为？",
          "next_node": "purpose"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_strength",
          "text": "听闻你实力不凡，可否指点一二？",
          "next_node": "strength_talk",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "xuewuhen",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_news",
          "text": "最近有什么消息？",
          "next_node": "news"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "没什么，告辞",
          "next_node": "END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "血刹教追求的是力量的极致。正道伪善，以仁义之名行压制之实。我们不过是不愿受那些条条框框束缚罢了。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xuewuhen",
          "value": 2,
          "reason": "愿意了解血刹教"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_understand",
          "text": "各有各的道理",
          "next_node": "understand_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": -3
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_reject",
          "text": "力量若无正义约束，终将为祸",
          "next_node": "reject_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "understand_response",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "哼...你倒不像那些满口仁义的伪君子。也许你我之间还有得聊。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xuewuhen",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "不抱偏见"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": -3,
          "reason": "认同魔道理念"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "reject_response",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "哼，又是一个被正道洗了脑的。罢了，道不同不相为谋。",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xuewuhen",
          "value": -5,
          "reason": "否定魔道"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "坚守正道立场"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "strength_talk",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "指点？血刹教的功法可不是随便能学的。不过看你筋骨尚可...我且告诉你一个秘密：真正的力量来自于突破极限的痛苦。",
      "emotion": "confident",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xuewuhen",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "交流修炼"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_interested",
          "text": "愿闻其详",
          "next_node": "dark_teaching"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_decline",
          "text": "多谢好意，我自有修炼之法",
          "next_node": "decline_response"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dark_teaching",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "血刹教有一式'血影步'，以血气为引，速度可在瞬息间提升数倍。不过此法反噬不小...你若有兴趣，改日我可以演示一番。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xuewuhen",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "愿意了解血刹教功法"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": -2,
          "reason": "接触魔道功法"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "decline_response",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "随你。不过记住，正道的那套花拳绣腿，真到了生死关头可救不了你。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "news",
      "speaker": "xuewuhen",
      "text": "我只关心一件事——变强。至于其他的...你去问那些闲人吧。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "next_node": "END"
    }
  ]
}
